00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,810
C.

2
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:07,440
Daniel and Kitty are talking about how to protect wild animals.

3
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:11,520
Work in pairs and talk about your ideas.

4
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:15,690
Use the conversation below as a model.

5
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:20,810
What can we do to protect wild animals?

6
00:00:20,810 --> 00:00:26,480
First, we should never eat wild animals. You're right.

7
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:34,920
Also, some people make things like bags and shoes from the fur or skin of wild animals.

8
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:39,080
We must make sure we don't buy these things.

9
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:47,350
Yes, we should also make sure we don't do bad things to wild animals' living spaces.

10
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:49,380
That's a great point.

11
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:53,100
And we can join an animal protection group.

12
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:55,550
What a good idea!
